WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.205
Use Board to see where open work is accumulating.

00:00:03.205 --> 00:00:08.105
In All Tickets, select the Board layout and read the status headings above the columns.

00:00:08.105 --> 00:00:10.875
Find a card by its ticket number and open it.

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:14.655
Use Status and Assignment inside the ticket for a status change.

00:00:14.655 --> 00:00:19.340
The board is an overview, not a reason to move a repair before the work is actually done.
